{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "#%@" : {
      "comment" : "A screen showing a list of items tagged with a specific hashtag. The argument is the hashtag.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "#%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ \u00b7 %@" : {
      "comment" : "File type and size, e.g. \"PDF \u00b7 1.2 MB\"",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ \u00b7 %2$@"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ \u00b7 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld" : {
      "comment" : "A countdown timer showing the number of seconds remaining.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld bits" : {
      "comment" : "A label showing the estimated number of bits of entropy in a password. The argument is the number of bits of entropy.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld bit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "^[%lld issue](inflect: true) to review" : {
      "comment" : "A subheading that describes the number of issues found in the vault. The argument is the number of issues.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "C\u1ea7n xem l\u1ea1i %lld v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A CSV export is **not encrypted**. Anyone with the file can read every password. Delete it after importing." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the security of a CSV export.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "B\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t CSV **kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u00e3 h\u00f3a**. B\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 ai c\u00f3 t\u1ec7p \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u1ecdc \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1ecdi m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u. H\u00e3y x\u00f3a n\u00f3 sau khi nh\u1eadp."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A second password for your most sensitive fields. Items can use this or their own code. If you forget it, those fields cannot be recovered." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the extra password.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "M\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u th\u1ee9 hai cho nh\u1eefng tr\u01b0\u1eddng nh\u1ea1y c\u1ea3m nh\u1ea5t. M\u1ed7i m\u1ee5c c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u n\u00e0y ho\u1eb7c m\u00e3 ri\u00eang. N\u1ebfu qu\u00ean, c\u00e1c tr\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u00f3 kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 kh\u00f4i ph\u1ee5c."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A zero-backend password manager. Your secrets are encrypted on-device and never leave it unencrypted." : {
      "comment" : "A description of Vaultify.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n m\u00e1y ch\u1ee7. B\u00ed m\u1eadt c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u00e3 h\u00f3a ngay tr\u00ean thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng bao gi\u1edd r\u1eddi \u0111i \u1edf d\u1ea1ng ch\u01b0a m\u00e3 h\u00f3a."
          }
        }
      }
    },
