        }
      }
    },
    "Uses Google to fetch site icons as login avatars. This reveals the sites you have logins for to Google; turn off to keep everything on-device." : {
      "comment" : "The footer for the \"Show website icons\" setting.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "D\u00f9ng Google \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea3i bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng trang web l\u00e0m \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp. Vi\u1ec7c n\u00e0y ti\u1ebft l\u1ed9 cho Google c\u00e1c trang b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n; t\u1eaft \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef m\u1ecdi th\u1ee9 tr\u00ean thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses k-anonymity \u2014 only the first five characters of each password\u2019s SHA-1 hash are sent. Passwords never leave your device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "D\u00f9ng k-\u1ea9n danh \u2014 ch\u1ec9 n\u0103m k\u00fd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a m\u00e3 b\u0103m SHA-1 m\u1ed7i m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1eedi \u0111i. M\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u kh\u00f4ng bao gi\u1edd r\u1eddi kh\u1ecfi thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb."
          }
        }
      }
    },
